WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:03.330
Another bad batch from the same supplier.

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:05.210
Still chasing a response?

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:10.360
With ICC Supplier Quality, the overdue
queue shows which corrective actions

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:14.900
need follow-up. Here, receiving inspection
found chipped edges on a batch of

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:19.560
cast housings. Open the supplier
corrective action request to see the exact

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.690
lot and how many parts were affected.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:25.290
The supplier's response explains what
changed at packout.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:28.900
Open the attached re-inspection report to
see the results for the

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:33.360
replacement lot. Your team has the
response and the evidence together when

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.150
it's time to verify the fix.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.860
Book a Supplier Quality demo with ISO
Certification Consultants.
